bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    stage2_test_runner_libunit_project_name_missing_2026-11-27, 0, "Rust seed resolve_name_variants rebound text .slice(a, b) calls to compiler.frontend.core.types.str_slice (code-point s[a:b] instead of byte-offset rt_slice_text_bytes), causing _sdn_strip_leading_comment_lines on manifests with multi-byte UTF-8 comment chars ahead of project: to slice mid-token ('ect:') and fail library-unit dyn-lib packaging with 'project.name is missing'. Source workaround in src/compiler/10.frontend/core/types.spl:36-38 delegates str_slice to s.substring(start, end_idx); seed fix landed in 3850673f958 (src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/pipeline/native_project/imports.rs); waiting-for: rebuilt Stage 2 passing test_runner_build end-to-end."

